h Republican advances, not the party that ultimately holds the district.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0238, "margin": -16.55}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0284, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0246, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0227, "margin": -17.0}]}